			"notes": "- **for security reasons images now have to be from imgur, freeimage, or imgbb** -- this shouldnt be too much of an issue as the mod has built-in imgur uploading anyways (this limitation can also be removed in .minecraft/signed_paintings.txt)\n- addded `/paintings upload (screenshot|file)` for uploading recent screenshots and arbitrary files to imgur without having to go via discord etc as a third party host\n- fixed incompatibility with [Fabrication & Forgery](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabrication)\n- fixed misalignment on shield images\n- fixed partial incompatibility with [Enhanced Block Entities](https://modrinth.com/mod/ebe)\n- failed images no longer show up as url suggestions\n- fixed incorrect tiling on the backs of signed paintings\n- fixed z-fighting for paintings in a few situations"
		},
